\* All TLC check configs for AntflyLsmWalCompaction.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflyLsmWalCompaction.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    MaxSeq = 4
    MaxSegment = 3
    BuggyCheckpointUnsynced = FALSE
    BuggyRotateCorruptTail = FALSE
    BuggyRetirePinned = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    SequenceOrder
    CompactionInputBounded
    RetiredSegmentsSafe
    ReaderPinsRetained
    CorruptTailOnlyOnCurrentSegment
    CheckpointOnlyCoversDurableWal
    Safety

